      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `2ba8522c71c463757abd189e2d4ebacadbd117a4497d70e66392a565f07f8acb--BurwoodLGA.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: BOCSAR — Crime statistics by LGA (NSW Bureau of Crime Statistics and Research)\n- Release or year: Current file checked 2026-11-01\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Summary of offences\" | bf959fc6810842a70ec2645b5b195d1b83336a3213042503fc6ea4426dfc39e6 | missing |\n| \"Premises Type\" | ad801e07bc6dd3e7ffc9aeae4c472d4e39366288a4a3da660ae465c1314be9d9 | missing |\n| \"Victims\" | e250c269b10aac52b2cf24adecfc4abcb4fabde6528bc8258927d9f486dc6b2b | missing |\n| \"Offenders\" | 231e382c268448a4a47f0084cc2ef69f334970649cc9685a5051d3f3fe7eb94d | missing |\n| \"Alcohol Related\" | 4a829945b14d7169e297a46977bdcb8b920ce8e4c8c9e9677deddbb8c029a680 | missing |\n| \"Month\" | 4186d54f0a91cf345e7a9b7ddaeb50094830b1918e9438238b0e6137e91dc5fb | missing |\n| \"Time\" | 6b2570c63887f7f768872a7a3e21e7c077ad7be47d5cb7d866dba5771a7f3da4 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
